# Common Authentication Passport (CAP) for ASP.NET Core

> **CAP (Common Authentication Passport)** is a header-based authentication scheme for ASP.NET Core Razor Pages (and MVC) applications running behind the Catalix gateway. The gateway forwards a signed `x-passport` header on every authenticated request; this package validates it and builds a standard `ClaimsPrincipal`.

## Prerequisites

- [.NET SDK](https://dotnet.microsoft.com/download) 8.0 or newer
- Your application deployed behind the Catalix gateway (which injects the `x-passport` header)

